  "extensions": {
    "ruleset": "host_contactgroups",
    "folder": "/",
    "properties": {
      "comment": "Critical hosts to admin teams"
    },
    "value_raw": ["admins", "network-team"],
    "conditions": {
      "host_tags": [
        {
          "key": "criticality",
          "operator": "is",
          "value": "critical"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

🏠 **2. Host Group Assignment (Swagger Format)**
```json
{
  "extensions": {
    "ruleset": "host_groups",
    "folder": "/",
    "properties": {
      "comment": "Database servers to appropriate groups"
    },
    "value_raw": ["database-servers", "production"],
    "conditions": {
      "host_name": {
        "match_on": ["db.*"],
        "operator": "match_regex"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

